## 🔄 Program Flow

```text
                  ┌─────────────────────┐
                  │  Solana Transaction  │
                  └──────────┬──────────┘
                             │
                             ▼
                  ┌─────────────────────┐
                  │ process_instruction │
                  └──────────┬──────────┘
                             │
                  ┌──────────┴──────────┐
                  │                     │
                  ▼                     ▼
        InitializeCounter       IncrementCounter
                  │                     │
                  ▼                     ▼
          Create Account          Read Account
                  │                     │
                  ▼                     ▼
          Store Initial Value      count + 1
                  │                     │
                  ▼                     ▼
             count = 42             count = 43
```

