## 🧠 What This Project Demonstrates

This project demonstrates several important Solana development concepts:

* Solana program entrypoints
* Instruction processing
* Account management
* Account ownership
* System Program account creation
* Rent-exempt account funding
* Borsh serialization
* Program error handling
* Solana program logging
* Safe arithmetic
* Native Rust Solana development
* Local blockchain testing with LiteSVM

