---

## 📚 Learning Goal

The main goal of this project is to understand how Solana programs work at a lower level using **Native Rust**, without relying on the Anchor framework.

It provides a simple starting point for learning:

```text
Rust
  ↓
Solana Program SDK
  ↓
Instructions
  ↓
Accounts
  ↓
Borsh Serialization
  ↓
On-chain State
```

